{title: Duniya}
{artist: Akhil Dhvani Bhanushali Luka Chhupi}
{key: D#}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#]Bulave tujhe yaar [F]ajj meri galiyan
[Gm]Basaun tere sang [F]main alag duniya
[D#]Bulave tujhe yaar [F]ajj meri galiyan
[Gm]Basaun tere sang [F]main alag duniyaa
[D#]Na aaye kabhi dono [F]me zara bhi faasle
[Gm]Bas ek tu ho ek [Dm]main hoon aur koyi na
[D#]Hai mera sab kuchh [F]tera tu samajh le
[Gm]Tu chaahe mere hakk [F]ki zameen rakh le
[Cm]Tu saanson pe bhi [F]naam tera likh de
[Gm]Main jiyun jab [Dm]jab tera dil dhadke
[D#]Tujhse mera yeh [Cm]jee nahi bharta
[D#]Kuchh bhi nahi [Cm]asar ab karta
[Gm]Meri raah tujhse, meri chaah tujhse
[Gm]Mujhe bas yahin reh jaana
[D#]Lagi hain teri [F]aadatein mujhe jab se,
[Gm]Hai tere bin [F]pal bhi baras lagte,
[D#]Bulaave tujhay yaar [F]aaj meri galiyan
[Gm]Basaun tere sang [Dm]mai alag duniya.
[D#]Jo hove tu udas [F]mujhe dekhe hass de
[Gm]Tu chaahe mere hakk [F]ki zameen rakh le
[Cm]Tu saanson pe bhi [F]naam tera likh de
[Gm]Main jiyun jab [Dm]jab tera dil dhadke
[D#]Tujhse mili toh [Cm]seekha maine hasna,
[D#]Aaya mujhe [Cm]safar mein theharna
[Gm]Main toh bhool gayi duniya ka pataa,
[Gm]Yaara jab se tujhay hai jaana.
[D#]Hai tu hi dil [F]jaan hai meri ab se
[Gm]Na zikra tera na [F]jaaye mere lab se
[D#]Bulave tujhe yaar [F]ajj meri galiyan
[Gm]Basaun tere sang [Dm]main alag duniya
[D#]Jo hove tu udas [F]mujhe dekhe hass de
