[Cm]Tu saanson pe bhi [F]naam tera likh de
[Gm]Main jiyun jab [Dm]jab tera dil dhadke
[D#]Pyar di [F]raawan utte
[Gm]Yaar tu [F]le aaya
[D#]Mainu jeene [F]da matlab
[Gm]Aaj [Dm]samajh aaya
